      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid 81ed9e7a-0766-54f4-8867-fbfcab69c51a)
  )
  (text "  Safety layers that do NOT depend on the MCU:  F101 fuse | S101 disconnect | S102 E-STOP 2NC | S103 ARM 2NO | R45 default-off pull-down |"
    (at 20 66.04 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.6 1.6))
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid 0624d854-3f53-5d76-bc2a-b0edffe8f291)
  )
  (text "                                                U3A pulse-length limiter (63-96 ms) | U3B gate-drive UVLO (8 V) | K101 opens when ARM chain opens."
    (at 20 71.12 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.6 1.6))
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid 898be0f6-b5b8-56df-9f96-d3b2ce878309)
  )
  (text "  Firmware layers: weld-enable state machine, latched faults, watchdog, stuck-on detection (battery sag / drain), thermal derating."
    (at 20 74.93 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.6 1.6))
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid 58048f4a-08e4-5272-a4b9-f2848ceb9123)
  )
